description: Keep Homebrew cask version in sync with git tags on every release
alwaysApply: true
---

# Releases

When shipping Cracker, the git tag, DMG name, and Homebrew cask must be the same version.

- Tag is `vX.Y.Z`. Cask `version` and DMG are `X.Y.Z` (no `v`).
- Update `Casks/cracker.rb` `version` in the same change as the release.
- Update `MARKETING_VERSION` in `Cracker.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj` to match.
- Commit, push `main`, then push the tag so Actions can attach `cracker-X.Y.Z.dmg`.
- Do not tag a release while the cask still points at an older version.
